{"event":"changes_requested","job_id":"docs-business-accounts-verification-requirements-document-requirements","reason":"Full 725-line pinned raw independently read; SHA-256 and five line-specific quote substrings match the trusted receipt, which equals the worker handoff. Most document, actor, version, format, age and country qualifications are accurately preserved, including the photo-ID two-file/one-file conflict. One material bank-proof age conflict remains understated: raw lines 92\u201394 exempt RIBs, cheques, online-banking records and TAMIEYTHPIO from the general issuance-date requirement (while dated RIB/online records must be under 12 months), but raw line 106 separately says documents issued more than 12 months ago are not accepted without stating those exceptions. The candidate and Q2 describe the exceptions as settled, which can mislead an implementer into accepting an older cheque or TAMIEYTHPIO. Preserve the conflicting statements without resolving their precedence. The new Business Accounts concept Sources anchor exists; direct provider-index discovery is coordinator-owned at close."}
